WEBVTT

00:00:11.480 --> 00:00:12.160
Safe!

00:00:12.780 --> 00:00:14.380
There's no mistaking it!

00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:19.000
With the injury in his right foot, he can't play at his best anymore!

00:00:20.130 --> 00:00:20.960
Injury!?

00:00:23.680 --> 00:00:27.300
With Shigeno's condition, we can't go into extra innings!

00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:29.760
We have to finish things off this inning!

00:00:30.380 --> 00:00:31.730
Hey, come on.

00:00:31.730 --> 00:00:33.950
Who can't fight in extra innings?

00:00:33.950 --> 00:00:35.170
If you're talking about me-

00:00:35.170 --> 00:00:36.080
Shut your hole!

00:00:36.080 --> 00:00:37.650
Injured people should stay quiet!

00:00:38.240 --> 00:00:41.230
We can't let it end like this!

00:00:41.860 --> 00:00:46.450
Do whatever you can to get in the ring and win before they take down Shigeno!

00:00:47.120 --> 00:00:48.620
Yeah!

00:00:52.270 --> 00:00:56.040
<i>Goro-kun's strength greatly surpassed my calculations.</i>

00:00:56.760 --> 00:01:01.170
<i>If he didn't have his foot injury,
he might have cornered us even further.</i>

00:01:02.590 --> 00:01:08.300
<i>If what Egashira-san said is true,
and we were to win because of that...</i>

00:01:11.210 --> 00:01:12.100
Sato!

00:01:18.810 --> 00:01:19.570
Safe!

00:01:19.570 --> 00:01:20.770
All right!

00:01:20.770 --> 00:01:22.110
We have a runner!

00:01:22.910 --> 00:01:25.670
Akutsu is going to hit 50 pitches soon.

00:01:25.670 --> 00:01:27.170
We usually bench him around then.

00:01:27.170 --> 00:01:29.320
I know that already!

00:01:29.320 --> 00:01:31.300
But they already have two outs.

00:01:31.300 --> 00:01:35.320
We'll replace Akutsu when he goes to bat this inning.

00:01:35.830 --> 00:01:40.390
If we can end it like that, we won't have to send out Mayumura.

00:01:43.630 --> 00:01:45.340
Hit, Taiga!

00:01:54.560 --> 00:01:56.170
<i>Let me be safe!</i>

00:01:56.170 --> 00:01:57.890
<i>I have to be safe!</i>

00:02:01.350 --> 00:02:02.900
Safe! Safe!

00:02:02.900 --> 00:02:04.860
They did it!

00:02:04.860 --> 00:02:06.290
Nice one!

00:02:06.290 --> 00:02:07.820
That was awesome!

00:04:01.570 --> 00:04:04.310
Looks like keeping Akutsu up on the mound backfired on us.

00:04:11.170 --> 00:04:12.820
You've got to be kidding me.

00:04:12.820 --> 00:04:14.070
This is bad, Mayumura.

00:04:14.500 --> 00:04:17.530
We're a run behind before you're coming out.

00:04:18.630 --> 00:04:19.740
Stop making a fuss.

00:04:19.740 --> 00:04:22.500
It's not like the game is over yet.

00:04:23.050 --> 00:04:26.260
Batting second: third baseman, Uchiyama-kun.

00:04:26.260 --> 00:04:28.610
Keep it going, Uchiyama!

00:04:34.810 --> 00:04:35.750
Ball!

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:38.970
<i>We should change pitchers now.</i>

00:04:38.970 --> 00:04:44.800
<i>With that one run, it's clear Akutsu is both physically and mentally at his limit!</i>

00:04:46.480 --> 00:04:49.260
Why are you taking your time getting one out!?

00:04:49.260 --> 00:04:50.600
Hurry up and finish this!

00:04:50.600 --> 00:04:51.690
You piece of crap!

00:04:53.900 --> 00:04:54.860
Dead ball!

00:04:56.110 --> 00:04:57.290
All right!

00:04:57.290 --> 00:04:58.870
It doesn't hurt! It doesn't hurt!

00:05:00.690 --> 00:05:03.750
Batting third: pitcher, Shigeno-kun.

00:05:07.750 --> 00:05:10.250
You still have time.

00:05:10.250 --> 00:05:15.550
He would be able to change this situation of course,
but he's also a man who would change this atmosphere.

00:05:17.810 --> 00:05:19.220
Call the bullpen!

00:05:19.700 --> 00:05:22.380
We announce a change of players.

00:05:22.380 --> 00:05:27.390
Replacing Kaido Academy High School's pitcher, Akutsu-kun...

00:05:29.610 --> 00:05:31.100
Mayumura-kun.

00:05:44.100 --> 00:05:45.790
<i>So you've finally come out, Iron Mask.</i>

00:05:46.200 --> 00:05:49.170
They finally brought out their trump card, huh?

00:05:49.170 --> 00:05:51.750
We really pulled him out at the end.

00:05:59.720 --> 00:06:02.060
<i>I've been waiting for this moment.</i>

00:06:02.060 --> 00:06:06.310
<i>I'll sink this one in and finish you off!</i>

00:06:06.780 --> 00:06:07.570
Play!

00:06:09.500 --> 00:06:10.500
<i>Please.</i>

00:06:10.500 --> 00:06:12.730
<i>Change this atmosphere, Mayumura!</i>

00:06:25.490 --> 00:06:26.620
Strike!

00:06:28.570 --> 00:06:29.550
I-It's fast.

00:06:29.550 --> 00:06:30.880
I-It's fast.

00:06:34.080 --> 00:06:35.300
Strike!

00:06:35.300 --> 00:06:37.420
W-What was that!?

00:06:37.420 --> 00:06:38.900
Was that a shootball!?

00:06:38.900 --> 00:06:42.390
He completely pierced it through the strike zone!

00:06:45.180 --> 00:06:46.880
<i>Incredible.</i>

00:06:46.880 --> 00:06:48.930
<i>So this is Mayumura, huh?</i>

00:06:51.400 --> 00:06:55.850
<i>As expected. The spin and accuracy of his breaking balls are exceptional.</i>

00:06:55.850 --> 00:07:00.360
<i>If I wait for that, I won't be able to even run to first base.</i>

00:07:00.360 --> 00:07:01.830
<i>If I'm going to aim for something,</i>

00:07:02.410 --> 00:07:04.660
<i>it has to be this fastball!</i>

00:07:06.070 --> 00:07:07.300
Strike!

00:07:07.300 --> 00:07:08.600
Batter out!

00:07:08.600 --> 00:07:10.530
Three outs! Change!

00:07:11.730 --> 00:07:15.350
A forkball with almost the same speed as a fastball!?

00:07:15.350 --> 00:07:17.170
Unbelievable.

00:07:25.780 --> 00:07:26.940
That was amazing.

00:07:26.940 --> 00:07:30.050
You got struck out and couldn't even graze it.

00:07:30.620 --> 00:07:33.260
I'm really glad we have a one run lead now.

00:07:33.260 --> 00:07:38.030
If they brought him out earlier, we would've had to finish with a draw at best.

00:07:45.180 --> 00:07:46.190
Let's go.

00:07:46.190 --> 00:07:47.450
Just three more outs left.

00:07:48.630 --> 00:07:49.650
Yeah.

00:07:50.080 --> 00:07:51.260
Really.

00:07:51.260 --> 00:07:53.990
You guys sure made a mess of things!

00:07:53.990 --> 00:07:55.620
It's the ninth inning! The ninth!

00:07:56.020 --> 00:08:00.590
Is the renowned Kaido going to be defeated in the quarterfinals of the prefectural tournament!?

00:08:00.590 --> 00:08:07.180
Not only could we barely score four runs against a weak unknown team like them, but they managed to force Mayumura out!

00:08:07.590 --> 00:08:08.600
Stop playing around!

00:08:08.600 --> 00:08:10.180
Turn the tables around no matter what it takes!

00:08:10.670 --> 00:08:13.310
You guys keep bunting pathetically.

00:08:13.310 --> 00:08:17.690
If you keep hitting the ball so that Shigeno runs and fields it, chances will open up for you!

00:08:18.290 --> 00:08:21.070
Carry on thoroughly targeting Shigeno's foot this inning!

00:08:21.070 --> 00:08:25.980
As long as you play as I order you to, it's impossible for us to lose!

00:08:27.480 --> 00:08:28.120
I refuse.

00:08:30.160 --> 00:08:31.120
What?

00:08:31.660 --> 00:08:34.870
I don't want to follow that kind of plan anymore.

00:08:35.550 --> 00:08:36.880
What!?

00:08:37.470 --> 00:08:41.260
We couldn't score a run in the last inning anyway.

00:08:41.270 --> 00:08:45.380
Moreover, if you injured Shigeno-kun's foot on purpose,

00:08:45.900 --> 00:08:50.850
I don't want to be a part of that kind of dirty conduct so that I could win!

00:08:53.900 --> 00:08:54.860
S-Sato.

00:08:54.860 --> 00:08:56.100
S-Sato.

00:08:57.600 --> 00:08:58.890
Oh?

00:08:58.890 --> 00:09:01.900
Is that all you wanted to say, Sato?

00:09:01.900 --> 00:09:03.070
Well?

00:09:03.530 --> 00:09:04.630
Kaido Academy.

00:09:04.630 --> 00:09:05.530
Batter up!

00:09:05.530 --> 00:09:07.490
Oh... Yes!

00:09:07.970 --> 00:09:09.910
Izumi, you know what to do!

00:09:09.910 --> 00:09:11.080
Just as planned!

00:09:11.720 --> 00:09:13.800
Don't worry about things over here.

00:09:13.800 --> 00:09:18.250
After this game is over, I'll have Sato dismissed from this baseball club.

00:09:23.260 --> 00:09:26.510
H-Hey. Apologize, Sato.

00:09:26.510 --> 00:09:29.440
I understand your feelings, but you had it coming with that remark.

00:09:29.440 --> 00:09:30.970
I won't apologize.

00:09:30.970 --> 00:09:33.590
What that man has done can't be forgiven.

00:09:34.200 --> 00:09:39.480
Even if we crushed Goro-kun and won, would you guys be proud!?

00:09:40.120 --> 00:09:43.390
Will you all be able to fight with pride at Koshien!?

00:09:46.060 --> 00:09:46.830
Play!

00:09:51.240 --> 00:09:52.260
Ball!

00:09:52.830 --> 00:09:54.380
H-Hey!

00:09:54.380 --> 00:09:56.630
Stop dashing out, you!

00:09:56.630 --> 00:09:58.580
Leave it to Miyazaki and Uchiyama!

00:10:01.540 --> 00:10:03.260
That idiot.

00:10:05.430 --> 00:10:06.390
All right.

00:10:06.390 --> 00:10:07.470
That's how it should be.

00:10:08.690 --> 00:10:11.710
Do you think you're cool acting like that, Sato?

00:10:12.140 --> 00:10:19.320
However he was injured, as long as he decides to stand on the mound, it doesn't concern us.

00:10:20.580 --> 00:10:24.700
He should be up there with that in mind.

00:10:24.700 --> 00:10:28.100
Besides, do you think he'd be happy being pitied?

00:10:32.470 --> 00:10:33.710
Strike!

00:10:34.930 --> 00:10:39.960
Of course none of us will feel good about this even if we manage to win.

00:10:40.390 --> 00:10:47.920
But I can't forget my last three years and think it's all right to lose here!

00:10:53.410 --> 00:10:58.350
I want to go to Koshien again and win!

00:11:02.020 --> 00:11:02.980
Damn it!

00:11:05.390 --> 00:11:06.190
Shigeno!

00:11:06.190 --> 00:11:07.150
Shigeno!!

00:11:09.230 --> 00:11:10.070
Safe!

00:11:10.070 --> 00:11:11.030
Good!

00:11:13.690 --> 00:11:17.240
Batting ninth: pitcher, Mayumura-kun.

00:11:17.800 --> 00:11:18.980
Kusano.

00:11:18.980 --> 00:11:20.500
You're right.

00:11:21.900 --> 00:11:26.700
Whatever method it may be, we choose the method that allows us to win. 

00:11:26.700 --> 00:11:28.690
That's Kaido's baseball.

00:11:33.070 --> 00:11:34.230
<i>Guys...</i>

00:11:34.230 --> 00:11:35.840
<i>Is that really it?</i>

00:11:36.420 --> 00:11:37.990
<i>I understand your feelings...</i>

00:11:37.990 --> 00:11:39.060
<i>But...</i>

00:11:39.060 --> 00:11:40.050
<i>But...!</i>

00:11:40.050 --> 00:11:41.890
<i>I can't!</i>

00:11:50.010 --> 00:11:50.970
All right.

00:11:50.970 --> 00:11:52.030
Go for it.

00:11:52.030 --> 00:11:54.530
Shigeno is close to giving up!

00:11:59.650 --> 00:12:01.540
Why aren't you getting ready to bunt!?

00:12:10.490 --> 00:12:11.810
<i>Mayumura!</i>

00:12:11.810 --> 00:12:14.300
<i>Are you going against me too!?</i>

00:12:14.300 --> 00:12:15.520
Hey.

00:12:15.520 --> 00:12:17.760
Someone bring Mayumura his windbreaker.

00:12:18.180 --> 00:12:19.140
Yeah.

00:12:19.140 --> 00:12:20.140
I'll take it to him.

00:12:23.340 --> 00:12:24.100
Thanks a lot.

00:12:25.360 --> 00:12:26.810
Why did you try to hit it?

00:12:26.810 --> 00:12:31.040
I just chose the best method.

00:12:31.680 --> 00:12:37.940
There's no point in bunting when Shigeno's pitching is weakening.

00:12:39.560 --> 00:12:40.290
You.

00:12:40.290 --> 00:12:41.660
Hurry up and go back in.

00:12:41.660 --> 00:12:43.100
O-Okay.

00:12:43.100 --> 00:12:44.220
I'm sorry.

00:12:46.760 --> 00:12:52.630
<i>Despite not bunting, that hit was supposed to clear the outfield.</i>

00:12:53.080 --> 00:12:56.590
Batting first: center fielder, Kusano-kun.

00:12:58.080 --> 00:13:00.550
<i>Why did you hit it, Mayumura!?</i>

00:13:00.550 --> 00:13:04.690
<i>We can't afford to choose how we win right now!</i>

00:13:08.470 --> 00:13:09.180
Out!

00:13:10.650 --> 00:13:13.140
They somehow cleared it up this time.

00:13:13.930 --> 00:13:15.180
Honda...

00:13:20.420 --> 00:13:23.830
Batting second: second baseman, Kokubu-kun.

00:13:23.830 --> 00:13:25.520
Let's just walk him.

00:13:25.520 --> 00:13:27.140
It'll mean we'll have to face the third and fourth batters, 

00:13:27.140 --> 00:13:30.300
but it's much easier to defend with the bases loaded and we could get a double play.

00:13:30.920 --> 00:13:34.490
Wasn't walking a batter a bad thing, and weren't you against it?

00:13:34.490 --> 00:13:35.630
You idiot.

00:13:35.630 --> 00:13:39.050
You always get fired up in situations like these.

00:13:41.520 --> 00:13:44.520
As expected from my beloved wife.

00:13:45.310 --> 00:13:46.650
Ball.

00:13:46.650 --> 00:13:47.690
Four balls.

00:13:49.580 --> 00:13:53.240
Batting third: third baseman, Yakushiji-kun.

00:13:56.110 --> 00:13:57.360
Good.

00:13:57.360 --> 00:13:58.820
We'll squeeze them further!

00:14:09.800 --> 00:14:15.550
<i>Even if we crushed Goro-kun and won, would you guys be proud!? </i>

00:14:18.270 --> 00:14:26.890
<i>But I can't forget my last three years and think it's all right to lose here.</i>

00:14:33.650 --> 00:14:35.030
<i>No one's wrong.</i>

00:14:35.690 --> 00:14:38.660
<i>The one that's wrong is Egashira!</i>

00:14:40.170 --> 00:14:44.510
<i>I'm going to go to Koshien having defeated him!</i>

00:14:46.760 --> 00:14:51.750
This is a free fansub.

00:14:46.760 --> 00:14:51.750
Not for sale or rent.

00:14:57.880 --> 00:14:59.350
Taiga!

00:15:07.130 --> 00:15:07.940
Out!

00:15:08.890 --> 00:15:10.170
All right!

00:15:09.440 --> 00:15:10.890
He did it!

00:15:10.890 --> 00:15:12.990
Shimizu-kun, nice catch!

00:15:12.990 --> 00:15:15.540
Just one more! One more!

00:15:15.540 --> 00:15:16.860
Did... Kaido miss a sign?

00:15:16.860 --> 00:15:19.610
Did... Kaido miss a sign?

00:15:20.000 --> 00:15:21.100
Shit!

00:15:21.100 --> 00:15:22.870
Yakushiji!

00:15:22.870 --> 00:15:24.050
You bastard!

00:15:24.050 --> 00:15:26.330
Do you know what you just did!?

00:15:28.520 --> 00:15:30.280
You bastard!

00:15:30.280 --> 00:15:33.880
Batting fourth: catcher, Sato-kun.

00:15:35.550 --> 00:15:37.010
Wait, Sato!

00:15:37.010 --> 00:15:40.300
Who said you could step into the batter's box!?

00:15:40.300 --> 00:15:42.610
Didn't I say you were dismissed!?

00:15:42.610 --> 00:15:43.300
Stand down!

00:15:45.010 --> 00:15:46.470
Miyake! You take his place!

00:15:48.260 --> 00:15:49.480
B-But...

00:15:49.480 --> 00:15:51.200
But what!?

00:15:51.200 --> 00:15:55.040
You just have to do as I ordered, bunt, and tie it up!

00:15:55.040 --> 00:16:00.650
Do you think I'd let an idiot who's gone against me go out to lose in the final at-bat!?

00:16:01.630 --> 00:16:03.060
Hey...

00:16:08.050 --> 00:16:08.950
Whatever.

00:16:08.950 --> 00:16:10.210
Yonekura!

00:16:10.210 --> 00:16:11.400
You go out then!

00:16:12.640 --> 00:16:14.080
Yes.

00:16:18.500 --> 00:16:20.260
Kusano.

00:16:21.530 --> 00:16:22.880
What's the meaning of this!?

00:16:22.880 --> 00:16:24.220
Haven't you had enough? {M: or "Isn't it enough?"}

00:16:24.690 --> 00:16:28.530
Shigeno is already weak because of the bunts and we've created our chance.

00:16:29.100 --> 00:16:37.180
We don't have the right to go to Koshien if we can't make this ninth inning ours by swinging when the bases are loaded!

00:16:37.720 --> 00:16:40.190
Please let Sato bat.

00:16:43.520 --> 00:16:45.040
You're right.

00:16:45.040 --> 00:16:46.510
Yeah.

00:16:46.510 --> 00:16:49.120
It shouldn't be me.

00:16:50.140 --> 00:16:51.260
Y-You bastards!

00:16:51.260 --> 00:16:53.370
Y-You bastards!

00:16:55.150 --> 00:16:56.330
Izawa!?

00:16:56.900 --> 00:16:58.330
Let go!

00:16:59.570 --> 00:17:02.300
I will take full responsibility for this.

00:17:04.880 --> 00:17:06.220
Go, Sato!

00:17:06.770 --> 00:17:08.850
Go win this with your swing!

00:17:10.020 --> 00:17:10.860
Yes!

00:17:17.670 --> 00:17:19.450
That's great, Izawa!

00:17:19.450 --> 00:17:21.980
Be prepared once this game is over!

00:17:21.980 --> 00:17:27.070
All those that went against me will be dealt with. Including you!

00:17:27.070 --> 00:17:31.330
We'll see who'll be dealt with.

00:17:31.330 --> 00:17:33.290
What!?

00:17:57.130 --> 00:17:58.230
<i>Goro.</i>

00:17:59.990 --> 00:18:01.190
<i>Just one more.</i>

00:18:01.610 --> 00:18:02.900
<i>Just one more. Just one more. Just one more.</i>

00:18:02.900 --> 00:18:04.400
<i>Just one more. Just one more. Just one more.</i>

00:18:04.400 --> 00:18:05.820
<i>Just one more. Just one more. Just one more.</i>

00:18:06.820 --> 00:18:08.820
Okay, let's go, Shigeno!

00:18:12.720 --> 00:18:13.910
Strike!

00:18:15.660 --> 00:18:17.380
<i>What was that!?</i>

00:18:17.380 --> 00:18:20.750
<i>It should be hard enough for him to even stand.</i>

00:18:20.750 --> 00:18:24.340
<i>How can you still throw a ball like this!?</i>

00:18:24.770 --> 00:18:26.860
<i>You're amazing, Goro-kun.</i>

00:18:27.750 --> 00:18:30.800
<i>You don't need me to hold back or pity you.</i>

00:18:30.800 --> 00:18:32.350
<i>As expected you are...</i>

00:18:32.350 --> 00:18:35.010
<i>someone I need to hit and go above!</i>

00:18:53.550 --> 00:18:54.370
It bounced!

00:18:55.580 --> 00:18:56.550
All right!

00:18:59.920 --> 00:19:00.710
Hattori!

00:19:05.190 --> 00:19:06.520
He's not home yet!

00:19:06.520 --> 00:19:08.890
As long as we get Toshi out!

00:19:13.680 --> 00:19:15.390
Safe! Safe!

00:19:15.390 --> 00:19:16.580
All right!

00:19:16.580 --> 00:19:17.640
We're tied! Tied!

00:19:19.050 --> 00:19:19.870
Miyazaki!

00:19:19.870 --> 00:19:21.100
Home plate!

00:19:21.100 --> 00:19:22.560
What!?

00:19:35.750 --> 00:19:37.030
Out!

00:19:42.540 --> 00:19:44.500
That sure was close.

00:19:44.500 --> 00:19:45.950
It's extra innings now.

00:19:56.870 --> 00:19:57.720
That was nice.

00:19:57.720 --> 00:19:58.840
You almost had it.

00:19:58.840 --> 00:20:00.250
You ran well.

00:20:02.320 --> 00:20:03.900
I won't accept this.

00:20:03.900 --> 00:20:07.070
I won't accept this game.

00:20:07.510 --> 00:20:09.770
Well, just do what you like.

00:20:10.470 --> 00:20:16.570
Even if you guys win, I'll prevent you all from participating in the semifinals, and crush you all with my hands.

00:20:23.170 --> 00:20:24.470
Coach.

00:20:24.470 --> 00:20:25.500
Don't worry about him.

00:20:25.960 --> 00:20:28.750
He doesn't have the authority to do that anymore.

00:20:50.230 --> 00:20:51.600
W-What are you guys doing here?

00:20:51.600 --> 00:20:52.990
W-What are you guys doing here?

00:20:53.690 --> 00:20:56.500
You've finally exposed yourself, Egashira.

00:20:56.500 --> 00:20:57.660
What?

00:20:58.430 --> 00:21:01.910
We were listening to your disgraceful behavior on the bench.

00:21:01.910 --> 00:21:05.620
It can't be... You had a game against him in order to injure him...

00:21:06.930 --> 00:21:09.290
Don't make me out to be the bad guy.

00:21:09.820 --> 00:21:13.880
He can protest however he likes, but there's no proof.

00:21:14.350 --> 00:21:18.850
You don't have to worry about anything. Just crush him completely!

00:21:22.430 --> 00:21:29.630
We've been carefully investigating your unworthy behavior as Chief Manager for a while now...

00:21:29.630 --> 00:21:31.320
under orders from the director.

00:21:31.780 --> 00:21:32.680
T-The director!?

00:21:32.680 --> 00:21:33.930
T-The director!?

00:21:33.930 --> 00:21:35.150
Yes.

00:21:35.150 --> 00:21:39.030
Kamata-kun, who was suspended, told us everything.

00:21:39.650 --> 00:21:46.040
He said he regrets using a strategy to injure Shigeno-kun's foot under your orders.

00:21:47.990 --> 00:21:49.750
You went too far.

00:21:50.640 --> 00:21:53.510
The players aren't your toys.

00:21:55.220 --> 00:21:57.460
I-I don't know anything.

00:21:57.460 --> 00:22:01.180
I don't know anything about this guy!

00:22:01.180 --> 00:22:04.670
We want to hear your story closely.

00:22:03.250 --> 00:22:04.670
I don't know anything!

00:22:04.670 --> 00:22:06.320
I know nothing!

00:22:06.320 --> 00:22:07.310
This is all a lie!

00:22:13.690 --> 00:22:15.250
What's the matter?

00:22:15.250 --> 00:22:17.200
They're taking their time starting.

00:22:17.200 --> 00:22:19.210
Maybe something happened.

00:22:35.260 --> 00:22:37.630
Show us your foot, Shigeno-kun.

00:22:39.560 --> 00:22:41.010
Huh?

00:22:41.010 --> 00:22:41.850
What for?

00:22:41.850 --> 00:22:44.070
There's no use hiding it.

00:22:44.070 --> 00:22:48.310
We can tell just by looking that the condition of your foot is bad.

00:22:48.960 --> 00:22:54.270
We can't turn a blind eye and let you continue to play in this state.

00:22:54.270 --> 00:23:00.410
We have the responsibility to order you to substitute players if the doctor thinks it's serious.

00:23:00.410 --> 00:23:02.870
C-Change!?

00:24:41.550 --> 00:24:43.680
We're coming to the end of extra innings.

00:24:44.340 --> 00:24:48.850
Carrying the feelings of my friends,
I throw my last pitch with all I've got.

00:24:49.720 --> 00:24:52.560
The game versus Kaido finally comes to a close!

00:24:53.120 --> 00:24:54.560
Next time, on Major:

00:24:54.560 --> 00:24:56.160
The Ace Covered in Wounds!

00:24:56.160 --> 00:24:58.510
Run to the stage of your dreams!
